         ---------  Version 1.0 -----------


SmokePing is a Network Latency Monitor working along
the lines of MRTG. It measures network latency to a
configurable set of destinations on the net and
displays its findings in easy to read Web pages.

SmokePing has special support for monitoring
hosts with dynamic IP addressing.

SmokePing uses RRDtool as its logging and graphing back-end.
This makes the system very efficient. The presentation of
the data on the Web is done through a CGI which creates
graphs on demand.

Learn more about SmokePing on:

  http://people.ee.ethz.ch/~oetiker/webtools/smokeping

