The WUUG (Windsor UNIX Users Group) in Windsor, Ontario, Canada, is
currently planning their next meeting.  It is to take place at the
University of Windsor, and all are welcome.  The meeting will take place in
mid-February, and another meeting is being prepared for mid-March 2002.

For more information you can visit our website located at
http://www.wuug.org/

Also, be sure to join our mailing list, intructions can be found at the
website.

Thanks,
Alan P. Laudicina

